So you wanted to do this, too.

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:30.590
Why are you saying that?

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.800
I want to do it with you.

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:33.760
I want to do it.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:36.810
Just let go and have some fun.

